Entry-Point-Name: Power_Tools Service
Entry-Point-Key: Power_ToolsService
Entry-Point: LD_LIBRARY_PATH=app/native/lib:/usr/lib/qt4/lib CASCADES_THEME=dark app/native/Power_ToolsService
