Entry-Point-Icon: native/icon.png
Entry-Point-Orientation: auto
Entry-Point-User-Actions: post_notification,access_shared,access_phone,control_phone,access_led_control,access_notify_settings_control,access_pimdomain_contacts,access_pimdomain_messages,access_sms_mms,access_location_services,read_geolocation,read_radio_modem_data,access_wifi_public,r
